rac13,-4,2\\right)$ is parallel to the line and points in the direction of increasing $t$. Its negative $\\left(-\\frac13,4,-2\\right)$ is also parallel, but points in the direction of decreasing $t$ and does not satisfy the requested orientation." 13194139534851 true]] :edb/tempids {} :edb/committed false :edb/speculative true}
